     The rreeaallppaatthh() function returns _r_e_s_o_l_v_e_d___p_a_t_h on success.  If the func‐
     tion was supplied NULL as _r_e_s_o_l_v_e_d___p_a_t_h, and operation did not cause er‐
     rors, the returned value is a null-terminated string in a buffer allo‐
